@found_hayat
title: Found HAYAT
new-page: true
subtitle: -1 budget. Benefits develop gradually over 18 months.
choose-if: {! return !AnatolianPeoplesSector.reason(Q,"found_hayat"); !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ {! return AnatolianPeoplesSector.reason(Q,"found_hayat"); !} +]
on-arrival: {! AnatolianPeoplesSector.apply(Q,"found_hayat"); !}

= Found HAYAT

HAYAT is a planned institution aimed at undertaking large-scale production investments by pooling the savings of workers, cooperatives, and other public partnerships. It is our ultimate goal in building a People's Sector and achieving economic democracy. The voices, resources, and labour of our working class will build our economy!

- @root: Continue.

