on-arrival: {! AnatolianPeoplesSector.apply(Q,"establish_iyak"); !}

= Found İYAK

The planned Workers' Mutual Aid Institution (İYAK) will generate funds for development by channelling workers' earnings into savings. In the long run, the returns from that development will contribute to workers' retirement and social needs.

- @root: Continue.

@reform_iyak
title: Reform İYAK
new-page: true
subtitle: No budget cost. Benefits develop gradually over 18 months.
choose-if: {! return !AnatolianPeoplesSector.reason(Q,"reform_iyak"); !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ {! return AnatolianPeoplesSector.reason(Q,"reform_iyak"); !} +]
on-arrival: {! AnatolianPeoplesSector.apply(Q,"reform_iyak"); !}

= Reform İYAK

Encourage İYAK to acquire shares in existing industrial firms, in addition to its investment activities, thereby enabling workers to have a say in their workplaces.

- @root: Continue.

@reform_meyak
title: Reform MEYAK
new-page: true
subtitle: No budget cost. Benefits develop gradually over 18 months.
choose-if: {! return !AnatolianPeoplesSector.reason(Q,"reform_meyak"); !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ {! return AnatolianPeoplesSector.reason(Q,"reform_meyak"); !} +]
on-arrival: {! AnatolianPeoplesSector.apply(Q,"reform_meyak"); !}

= Reform MEYAK

Although MEYAK has collected a large sum from civil servants, the money has neither been invested nor transferred anywhere because the institution lacks the mechanisms it needs to operate. Its funds remain idle and unusable. We will reform the institution, ensure that it functions properly, and put those funds to use!

- @root: Continue.

