= Establish Cooperative Umbrella Organizations

The cooperative umbrella organizations plan will transform fragmented village cooperatives into self-governing producer organizations capable of large-scale economic activity. It will encourage nationwide capital accumulation and the creation of large agricultural enterprises. These self-governing institutions will help establish economic democracy among our largest demographic and offer rural communities alternatives to the old ağa class for economic, cultural, and legal assistance.

- @root: Continue.

