= Expand Cooperative Umbrella Organizations

We have begun transforming small cooperatives into larger organizations. We must now invest further in this programme to achieve its objectives.

- @root: Continue.

@peoples_sector
title: Integrate People's Sector into the Five Year Plan
new-page: true
choose-if: {! return Q.CHP_in_government && ((Q.economic_minister_party == "CHP" || (typeof AnatolianCoalitions!=="undefined"&&AnatolianCoalitions.ministryAccess(Q,"economic"))) || (Q.finance_minister_party == "CHP" || (typeof AnatolianCoalitions!=="undefined"&&AnatolianCoalitions.ministryAccess(Q,"economic")))); !}
unavailable-subtitle: Requires the Ministry of Economics or Finance.

= Integrate People's Sector into the Five Year Plan

The Turkish economy is still developing and needs broad, long-term, state-led growth programmes to build its industry. Our republic has used Five Year Plans, with an interruption between 1939 and 1960. Integrating the People's Sector into these large-scale economic projects will allow us to pursue development and economic democracy together.

- @integrate_sector: Integrate the People's Sector
- @fund_sector: Allocate funds to People's Sector
- @economic_democracy: Back.

@cooperative_bank
title: Establish the Cooperative Bank
new-page: true
choose-if: {! return Q.CHP_in_government && (Q.agriculture_minister_party == "CHP" || (typeof AnatolianCoalitions!=="undefined"&&AnatolianCoalitions.ministryAccess(Q,"agriculture"))); !}
unavailable-subtitle: Requires the Ministry of Agriculture.

= Establish the Cooperative Bank

The Cooperative Bank will give small producers access to credit without requiring them to mortgage their land or other assets. By financing productive investments through cooperatives, it will bring modern financial services to rural communities in a form suited to their needs.

- @found_bank: Found the Cooperative Bank
- @fund_bank: Allocate funds to Cooperative Bank
- @economic_democracy: Back.

